e most Warden Souls within the time limit wins the match. If the results end in a tie, The first team that can take down an enemy Visitor wins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334220/extras/bf2c195d91ab270a9eb3356aac12ba94.avif?t=1742593003\" /></span><br><br>Wardens that revert back to being a Visitor will receive a &quot;Karma Points&quot; based on how many Visitors they eliminated. If the other team's Warden eliminates the reverted Visitor, they will receive the Karma points as bonus points for the team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334220/extras/ba8ed49751c3ececef4812bd767cebc4.poster.avif?t=1742593003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334220/extras/ba8ed49751c3ececef4812bd767cebc4.webm?t=1742593003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334220/extras/ba8ed49751c3ececef4812bd767cebc4.mp4?t=1742593003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Niwarn is the dimension between the human and spirit world. The reason souls end up being trapped in Niwarn can come from a person being in a limbo between life and death or cursed with dark magic . People with strong arcanic powers often use their powers to control the Warden to hunt down the Visitors that end up wandering into Niwarn. They hunt for their souls to complete an unexplained ritual.<br><br>",
